---
id: AD-Autentikasi-Login
title: Activity Diagram - Autentikasi Login
---
flowchart TD
  A([Mulai]) --> B[User buka halaman login]
  B --> C[Isi username/email dan password]
  C --> D[Klik Login]
  D --> E{Validasi kredensial}
  E -- Tidak valid --> F[Tampilkan pesan gagal]
  F --> C
  E -- Valid --> G[Set session/login]
  G --> H{Cek role user}
  H -- Pegawai --> I[Redirect dashboard pegawai]
  H -- Manager --> J[Redirect dashboard manager]
  H -- HR --> K[Redirect dashboard HR]
  H -- Super Admin --> L[Redirect dashboard admin]
  I --> Z([Selesai])
  J --> Z
  K --> Z
  L --> Z
